1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,333
This is my wedding.

2
00:00:01,333 --> 00:00:03,416
I don't need a hall
pass to invite my friends.

3
00:00:04,291 --> 00:00:06,000
This is the Holy Cathedral,

4
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,666
  a place even King Byas rarely enters.

5
00:00:09,041 --> 00:00:11,083
And you bring
two filthy miners here?

6
00:00:11,083 --> 00:00:12,791
You are trying to
humiliate me on purpose!

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:14,500
When we got engaged, 

8
00:00:14,916 --> 00:00:17,583
your father was nothing but a miner himself.

9
00:00:18,291 --> 00:00:20,166
What, you’ve forgotten where you came from?

10
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:22,083
You…

11
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,500
I chose you 

12
00:00:24,583 --> 00:00:27,291
because I saw something real and pure in you.

13
00:00:27,875 --> 00:00:30,416
I defied my father
and got engaged anyway.

14
00:00:31,291 --> 00:00:33,083
But vanity consumed you.

15
00:00:34,791 --> 00:00:36,500
Are you saying
our family only rose

16
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,333
because of your so-called protection?

17
00:00:39,375 --> 00:00:40,125
Severin,

18
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,208
have you lost your goddamn mind?

19
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:45,416
A disowned failure standing here badmouthing

20
00:00:45,416 --> 00:00:47,166
the most desired woman in Emeraldstone?

21
00:00:48,208 --> 00:00:51,250
I can’t stand this trash for one more second.

22
00:00:52,666 --> 00:00:54,750
Redmond, where is your father?

23
00:00:56,750 --> 00:00:58,000
They should be here any moment.

24
00:00:58,541 --> 00:00:59,958
I sent someone to check.

25
00:01:02,416 --> 00:01:05,291
Make way for Count Arthur Carter!

26
00:01:11,916 --> 00:01:12,833
Forgive my late arrival.

27
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:14,833
I haven’t been well today.
